'' '-x' and '-o' from a '#cmdline' must be relative paths with no '..': fbc lets a source put
'' its program anywhere the user can write. The relative one is accepted and not reported.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --parse-only tests/driver/src/cmdline-x-escape.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 2
'' EXPECT-OUT: error TKO0178: '-x' is not allowed in a #cmdline: a source may name its output only relative to the build, without '..'
'' EXPECT-OUT: error TKO0178: '-o' is not allowed in a #cmdline
'' EXPECT-OUT: error TKO0178: '-x' is not allowed in a #cmdline
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 3
